# Arm migration (agent/gcp-multitopology-v3): narrow exceptions so the
# corrected Cycle B2 corpus can be committed through Git LFS without
# exposing cycle-a/cycle-b (old) or any future cycle's shards. Raw scenario
# .npz arrays stay ignored everywhere, including cycle-b2 -- those are
# preserved as compressed archives under artifacts/migration/ instead (see
# .gitattributes and docs/ARM_MIGRATION.md).
!data/learning-v2/cycle-b2/tensors/**/*.safetensors
!data/learning-v2/cycle-b2/tensors-normalized/**/*.safetensors
